00:26:11.326 --> 00:26:12.710
you can go to business school,

00:26:12.710 --> 00:26:14.870
but if it's not your natural talent,

00:26:14.870 --> 00:26:16.923
there is a potential,

00:26:18.054 --> 00:26:19.150
there's a likelihood,

00:26:19.150 --> 00:26:21.870
that you're not able to
build a sustainable life,

00:26:21.870 --> 00:26:23.713
happy and successful.

00:26:25.490 --> 00:26:27.970
